# daniel_pauls_quest_one
# Granted by Councillor Mosley's hand-in (see mosley_vape_quest_one.quest, node nag_two) once the
# player returns his vape. A simple "go talk to Daniel Pauls" quest that hooks into a follow-up
# Daniel Pauls quest, per the owner (not authored yet).
#
# STRUCTURE ONLY — Daniel's dialogue is intentionally left as [TODO:]. Do not fill it until the
# owner dictates his lines in a future session; do not write it yourself.
#
# Preset_DanielPauls.QuestKey is currently blank — must be set to "danielpauls" on his placed
# instance in the Inspector before this can be tested (see docs/reference/QUEST_TEXT_FORMAT.md).
# A TALKTO stage completes automatically on interacting with the keyed QuestActor — no COMPLETE:
# directive needed in his dialogue for this stage type.

QUEST daniel_pauls_quest_one
TITLE: [TODO: quest title]
GIVER: Daniel Pauls
LOCATION: [TODO: where this sends the player]
STAGE TALKTO danielpauls
OBJECTIVE: [TODO: go talk to Daniel Pauls]
REWARD
POUNDS: 0
XP: 0

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO DIALOGUE BLOCK HERE, DELIBERATELY.
#
# quests/spark_of_talent.quest owns Daniel Pauls' entire conversation. Only one file may declare
# DIALOGUE danielpauls: each import regenerates Dialogue_danielpauls.asset wholesale, so a second
# declaration would silently clobber the first depending on file order.
#
# To give Daniel something to say about THIS quest, add nodes to spark_of_talent.quest and gate
# them on daniel_pauls_quest_one — e.g. a choice on his NODE start carrying
#   GATE: active daniel_pauls_quest_one
#
# The TALKTO stage above still completes on interacting with him, whichever conversation runs.
